usage: recovery.py [-h] {backup,archive,recover,check-start} ...

Offline Linux checkpoint backup + bounded archive replay, not a BoltDB
converter. Requires an operator-confirmed stopped collector, confirmed healthy
legacy cut, unchanged config and independently complete stable-ID source
archive. Never edits BoltDB internals, deletes failed state, or promises
exactly-once delivery.

positional arguments:
  {backup,archive,recover,check-start}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
